			"date": "2022-12-11T02:49:19.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.social/@coryd\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>coryd</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> I’ve seen a Singer sewing machine last longer than I’ve been alive. But no guarantees that their quality is anywhere near the same level.</p>",
